-- **An import that travels** (MS11 phase 287, his ruling of 2026-11-03): this
-- file passes `Bit` on, so whoever imports this one may write `Bit.Bit` without
-- importing `Bit` themselves. `Pair.thena` is the same file with a plain
-- `import`, and `OnlyPair.thena` is what that costs an importer.
module test.modules.PassesBit where

public import test.modules.Bit

mine : Bit.Bit
mine = Bit.off
